Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a heat in the pavement\N路面蒸腾着热浪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My mercury's raising\N体温在上升
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know if it's love or if it's ovulation\N分不清是心动还是生理躁动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're holding a hammer\N当你手握铁锤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything looks like a nail\N万物皆似钉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The mist from the fountain is kissing my neck\N喷泉薄雾轻吻我颈间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The liquid crystal is in my grip\N流光溢彩尽在掌心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone with a snake tongue\N若遇口蜜腹剑者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I show 'em the chambers of my heart\N我敞开心房任其窥探
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know you don't deal much in love and affection\N明知你鲜少触碰情爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I really do think there could be a connection\N却坚信你我必有羁绊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I burn and I sing and I scheme and I dance\N我燃烧 我歌咏 我谋划 我起舞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Some days, I'm a woman, some days, I'm a man\N今日为女 明日为男
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.03,0:01:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have been born again\N我如获新生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to feel like I don't have the answers\N甘愿拥抱未知
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's peace in the madness over our heads\N癫狂之上仍有安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it carry me o-o-o-o-on\N任我随波逐流
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll go to Canal Street, they're piercing my ears\N此刻前往运河街 穿耳为孔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making a wish when the needle goes in\N银针入体时默许心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Take an aura picture, read it and tell me who I am\N摄我灵光 解读真我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me who I am\N揭示我本相
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know you don't deal much in love and affection\N明知你鲜少触碰情爱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.97,0:01:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I really do think you can make an exception\N但信你愿为我破例
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a beautiful life, so I play truant\N人生绚烂 何不逃学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.59,0:01:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I jerk tears and they pay me to do it, oh\N贩卖眼泪 众人买单
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.39,0:02:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have been born again\N我如获新生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.71,0:02:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to feel like I don't have the answers\N甘愿拥抱未知
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it carry me o-o-o-o-on\N任我随波逐流
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it break me down till I'm just a wreck\N任它将我碾作残骸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Till I'm just a voice living in your head\N直至成你脑中回响
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fxxked-up world, been to hell and back\N这混乱不堪的世界 我穿越过地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.12,0:02:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've sent you a postcard from the edge\N却在深渊之崖寄你明信片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.87,0:03:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The edge\N深渊之崖